I'll analyze the `engine.py` file and split it into logical sub-modules while keeping all methods in the main `engine.py` module for backward compatibility.

## Plan

1. **`codx/junior/engine/knowledge_engine.py`** - Knowledge-related operations
2. **`codx/junior/engine/code_engine.py`** - Code generation and improvement
3. **`codx/junior/engine/git_engine.py`** - Git/branch operations
4. **`codx/junior/engine/file_engine.py`** - File operations
5. **`codx/junior/engine/chat_engine_actions.py`** - Chat-related actions
6. **`codx/junior/engine/wiki_engine.py`** - Wiki operations
7. **`codx/junior/engine/__init__.py`** - Package init
8. **`codx/junior/engine.py`** - Updated main engine (imports from sub-modules)

---

